Third-party material
--------------------

SpoolForge bundles a normalized snapshot of the Open Filament Database.

Open Filament Database
Copyright (c) Open Filament Collective contributors
Licensed under the MIT License. The complete upstream license is bundled as
app/src/main/assets/OFD-LICENSE.txt and remains available in the source snapshot.

The ELEGOO CANVAS compatibility codec derives its documented byte layout and
code tables from Blumlaut/filament-rfid-writer, revision 26086675, under the
MIT License. The upstream license is bundled as research/sources/blumlaut/LICENSE.

The Creality CFS interoperability codec is based on public protocol and tag
format facts documented by MakaiView/cfs-programmer revision 52349f4f and
cross-checked against soylentOrange/K2-RFID revision b4f2760c. The former is
MIT licensed; the latter is GPL-3.0-or-later. SpoolForge's implementation is
independent and does not copy GPL implementation code.
